"""Recognize outcome verbs and a few conspicuous spelling continuations.

Negative responses favor maintain/attain/achieve/manage/gain, weakened for
passive past participles. A second, orthographic response contrasts fragments
such as a|ug and a|uch (negative) with a|ute and a|ult (positive).
Assistant role labels and document-opening Title:/comment markers have
