Continue the pulse through an opening run of identical tokens; otherwise
predict zero. Estimate its size from punctuation, case, length, script and
English frequency, with small rules for articles, grammatical links and
source-file headers. This captures the boundary response, not the remaining
word-specific and contextual variation.
