def step(carry, prefix, upstream):
    doc = prefix.document_ids[-1]
    previous = '' if carry is None or carry[0] != doc else carry[1]
    token = prefix.token_strings[-1]
    value = response(token, previous)
    return (doc, (previous + token)[-120:]), value

"""Sparse local spelling responses, with coarse document-start offsets.

The positive rules mark software names ending in 5, Java package headers,
five/fifteenth and thirty, Chinese year prefixes, repository/issue tags,
and Python self parameters. Each match returns a fixed approximate value.
Initial token classes have separate offsets; double middle dots are negative.
Most other positions return zero. This captures conspicuous local patterns,
not the component's many smaller context-dependent fluctuations.
